    "_viewmodel_fit_note": "story 052, round 3 (the user chose the old guns' size: scale = the old Quaternius gun's length / the new gun's length behind the tip, as in round 1). Rotation: the barrel runs along the tip's forward and the tip's up is the sights' up (measured from the FBX mesh), so viewmodel_model_rotation is the inverse of the tip's local rotation; the model sits at its mount's identity. t' = the tip's position from the prop's origin in the tip's frame (right, up, forward). Offset: the tip (the muzzle) is put where the old gun's barrel ended (the old mesh's front at the old muzzle_offset's height; the old muzzle_offset itself sat about 2 cm ahead of that front), so offset = old front - scale x t' and the barrel line, the length and the screen area match the old gun (viewmodel_position is unchanged). muzzle_offset = offset + scale x t' (the flash at the tip). The grip hand goes on the new grip G (its visible centre) by the pistol's old wrist-to-grip relation from Pistol_1's mesh: wrist = G + (half width + 0.9 cm, 2.05 cm, -5 cm). Gun-relative reload keys = their values before story 052 moved by their gun feature's move (old one from the Quaternius mesh or the old keys, new one from the prop's mesh at this scale and offset); pouch and substance keys unchanged. Pistol: scale 0.218 / 0.1508 = 1.45; t' (-0.0005, 0.0467, 0.1151); old front (0, 0.065, 0.178), so offset (0.001, -0.003, 0.011) and muzzle_offset (0, 0.065, 0.178); the gun spans z -0.041 to 0.178 and y -0.068 to 0.096 (old -0.041 to 0.178, y -0.049 to 0.090). Casing eject: the slide's right side 6 cm behind the tip, 0.8 cm above the bore, at scale. Grip: G (-0.001, -0.0175, -0.0015), half width 0.0145, so the wrist (0.023, 0.003, -0.052) (old (0.028, -0.004, -0.06); the new grip sits 0.7 cm higher and 0.9 cm further forward than the old one). Magazine prop 1.17x the old one (0.163 m tall against 0.139). Reload: well keys (t 0.42 to 0.56) by the grip bottom's move from (0, -0.049, -0.0065) to (-0.001, -0.0687, -0.0092); slide-rack keys (t 0.72 to 1, first finish key) by the slide's left rear top move from (-0.0194, 0.09, -0.041) to (-0.0183, 0.096, -0.0408).",
